{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026金馬影展閉幕片《花臉貓：修羅道》昨晚（21日）在影展首映，導演王逸帆晚間率領日本超人氣男星福士蒼汰、韓寧、黃冠智、塚原大助等主演現身閉幕活動和映後與觀眾見面。</p><p>曾以《巴別塔》提名奧斯卡的演技派女星菊地凜子，也帶着新作《愛到舞春》壓軸現</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:03:48.000904+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:23:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:57:13.753470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:57:13.753470+00:00","content_hash":"2616ce91a7456fe94c8ea7aaa8498e0d4c721435018fee24a16ff9593a0fb82d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}